{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21619","headline":"赠崔元儒 · 元稹","name":"赠崔元儒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷勤夏口阮元瑜，二十年前旧饮徒。\n最爱轻欺杏园客，也曾辜负酒家胡。\n些些风景闲犹在，事事颠狂老渐无。\n今日头盘三两掷，翠娥潜笑白髭须。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}